# Avatar's Wrath stops casting spells, nothing else (CR 101.2, 602.1, 707.10). Bot1 casts it turn 1 with no creature on the
# battlefield. In Bot2's turn 2, barred, it casts from its hand freely (four Moxen, Black Lotus, Faithless Looting) and
# discards Seasoned Pyromancer to the Looting. With mana for it, Faithless Looting's flashback from the graveyard is refused;
# Seasoned Pyromancer's ability, activated from the graveyard, is no spell and makes two Elementals; and Brain Freeze, cast
# from the hand after six other spells, is copied six times by storm - copies put onto the stack, not cast - so Bot1 mills
# seven times three cards.

